<title>AUSTRIA: Austria October c/a deficit up at 12.4 bln ATS.</title>
<headline>Austria October c/a deficit up at 12.4 bln ATS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank reported the following economic indicator details on Wednesday.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN CURRENT ACCOUNT     OCTOBER   SEPTEMBER     OCT. 95</p>
<p> Current account balance ATS  -12.4 bln   -6.1 bln	-10.1</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance    -10.5 bln   -9.1 bln	 -7.1</p>
<p> Exports			     68.5 bln   59.2 bln	 63.0</p>
<p> Imports			     76.4 bln   68.4 bln	 69.5</p>
<p>CUMULATIVE FIGURES (JANUARY TO MONTH IN QUESTION)</p>
<p> Current account balance ATS  -48.4 bln  -36.0 bln     -40.6</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance    -36.6 bln  -57.3 bln     -26.3</p>
<p> Exports			    627.0 bln  558.5 bln     598.7</p>
<p> Imports			    692.2 bln  615.8 bln     662.8</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
